'''Wald''' was a [[Rodian]] [[Gender|male]] who was [[Slavery|enslaved]] and lived on [[Tatooine]] during the time of the [[Invasion of Naboo|Naboo Crisis]]. He was one of [[Anakin Skywalker]]'s playmates in the [[Mos Espa]] [[Slave Quarters Row]]. He and [[Kitster Banai]], along with the droids [[R2-D2]] and [[C-3PO]], formed Anakin's pit team at the [[Boonta Eve Classic]] [[Podracing|podrace]]. At the time, Wald was six [[Standard year|years]] old.<ref name="Episode I" /> Along with Kitster and many others, Wald was eventually rescued from slavery by [[Sabé]] and [[Tonra]] and made a life for himself with many former enslaved individuals at a [[Gabredor III colony|colony]] on [[Gabredor III]].<ref name="Vader 23">[[Darth Vader (2020) 23|''Darth Vader'' (2020) 23]]</ref>

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Wald was played by [[Warwick Davis]],<ref name="Episode I" /> who also played various other characters like [[Wicket Wystri Warrick|Wicket W. Warrick]] in [[Star Wars: Episode VI Return of the Jedi|''Return of the Jedi'']],<ref name="VI">{{Film|VI}}</ref> [[Weeteef Cyu-Bee]] in ''[[Rogue One: A Star Wars Story]]'',<ref name="RO">''[[Rogue One: A Star Wars Story]]''</ref> and [[Weazel]] in ''[[Star Wars: Episode I The Phantom Menace|The Phantom Menace]]''<ref name="Episode I" /> and ''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]''.<ref name="Solo">''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]''</ref>

